To successfully open and explore the Final Airbnb Dashboard,
ensure that Microsoft Power BI Desktop is preinstalled on your system,
as .pbix files require this specific application to run.

You can download the project file directly from the Final Airbnb Dashboard Google Drive Link. 

---( https://drive.google.com/file/d/1drxdna-cPWsU9hrkVRRZN7RWflTzwMku/view?usp=sharing )---
 
Once downloaded, simply double-click the file to launch it in Power BI Desktop, 
where you can interact with the visualizations, analyze booking trends, 
inspect property listings, and explore the underlying data model.
